      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The motivation for MDR follows from Equation 15.7a. We first present the method under the assumption of a single QTL to illustrate the main points before extending it to multiple QTLs. Suppose there are n linked markers on a chromosome containing a single QTL (with alleles Q and q). If the ith marker is at recombination frequency $ c_i $ from the QTL, the expected difference between marker homozygote means is",
